      "title": "AceHack 5.0 Hackathon Journey — Day 1",
      "slug": "acehack5-day1-hackathon-journey",
      "excerpt": "Today I started my hackathon journey by participating in AceHack 5.0. This is Day 1 of the event and the beginning of an exciting experience where I will collaborate, build projects, and learn new technologies.",
      "content": "AceHack 5.0 Hackathon Journey — Day 1\n\nToday I started an exciting experience in my developer journey by participating in AceHack 5.0. This is a 2-day hackathon, and today marks Day 1 of the event.\n\nI am participating in this hackathon with my team Akatsuki. Our team represents VGU Jaipur, and we are excited to build something innovative during this event.\n\nOur team captain is my friend Vedaang, who is leading the team during the competition. Hackathons are not only about coding but also about teamwork, problem solving, and building ideas under time pressure.\n\nFor me, this hackathon is a great opportunity to collaborate with other developers, learn new technologies, and gain real experience in building projects quickly.\n\nThis experience also connects with my platform CodeUpPath, where I aim to help students discover hackathons, tech competitions, free courses, and learning opportunities in one place.\n\nToday is the beginning of this 2-day journey, and I am excited to see what our team will build during AceHack 5.0.\n\nThis blog will document my hackathon journey and the lessons I learn along the way.",
